# spark embers.env -- conversational models with a purpose. An ember is the
# second, bigger model `spark ember NAME` adds beside the small one at the
# prompt (spark stays small there; the ember is for `spark chat`). Open
# licenses only, like models.env; each row is a pull request naming its
# purpose and its license. `spark ember list` shows these rows marked `e`,
# each followed by its purpose line.
#
# Row shape: MODEL_<NAME> as models.env (file url bytes sha256 ram_gb),
# plus two more keys per model:
#   EMBER_<NAME>_PURPOSE="..."             one line, shown under the row
#   MODEL_<NAME>_LICENSE="<spdx> <url>"    required
#
# Sizes and sha256 come from Hugging Face's LFS metadata; bootstrap.sh
# verifies the sha256 before a file is kept. All Q4_K_M unless noted.
MODEL_QWEN2_5_CODER_7B="Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf https://huggingface.co/bartowski/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct-GGUF/resolve/main/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf 4683074336 1664fccab734674a50763490a8c6931b70e3f2f8ec10031b54806d30e5f956b6 7"
EMBER_QWEN2_5_CODER_7B_PURPOSE="code: reads and writes programs, explains errors"
MODEL_QWEN2_5_CODER_7B_LICENSE="Apache-2.0 https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct"
MODEL_QWEN3_4B_THINKING="Qwen_Qwen3-4B-Thinking-2507-Q4_K_M.gguf https://huggingface.co/bartowski/Qwen_Qwen3-4B-Thinking-2507-GGUF/resolve/main/Qwen_Qwen3-4B-Thinking-2507-Q4_K_M.gguf 2497280736 64ce5838a76b4d63071289c17ed04525265a47abf51546cd747a30e41b7687fa 5"
EMBER_QWEN3_4B_THINKING_PURPOSE="reasoning: thinks before it answers -- slower, for hard questions"
MODEL_QWEN3_4B_THINKING_LICENSE="Apache-2.0 https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Thinking-2507"
